{
  "info": {
"_postman_id": "c0f73e1e-c993-4845-a8d6-0f47273e3d71",
    "name": "Theron Wallet API - B2B Integration",
    "description": "Collection oficial para testes de integração B2B da Theron Wallet.\n\nFluxo recomendado: Health → Login Admin → Criar OAuth Client → Token B2B → **Onboarding Asaas (B2B)** → Consultas → Cobranças (Boleto / Cartão / PIX) → Antecipações.\n\nA Theron cria Organization + Account + OAuth. O parceiro provisiona a **subconta Asaas** com `POST /asaas/onboarding/b2b` (scopes `onboarding.read` / `onboarding.submit`) — sem login no site do produto.\n\n**Credenciais:** o Platform Owner da Theron cria e fornece `client_id` e `client_secret` ao integrador. Não publique credenciais reais nem `ASAAS_API_KEY`.\n\n**Cobrança PIX / QR:** use `billingType: \"PIX\"`. O pagador acessa o QR Code pela `invoiceUrl` retornada na resposta (fatura Asaas). Nesta API B2B não há endpoint separado com payload EMV/copia-e-cola.\n\n**Sandbox:** a antecipação efetiva pode não ser testável porque a própria Asaas não disponibiliza essa operação no Sandbox.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "https://theron-wallet-backend-production.up.railway.app" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup Admin",
      "description": "JWT de Platform Admin. Preencha organization_id e account_id no Environment antes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login admin 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = j.accessToken || j.token;",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('admin_access_token', token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('admin_access_token salvo', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.environment.get('admin_access_token')).to.be.ok;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\",\n  \"deviceId\": \"{{device_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Autentica Platform Admin. Grava admin_access_token no Environment."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create OAuth Client (1:1 Account)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Create client 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.clientId) pm.environment.set('client_id', j.clientId);",
                  "if (j.clientSecret) pm.environment.set('client_secret', j.clientSecret);",
                  "if (j.id) pm.environment.set('oauth_client_uuid', j.id);",
                  "if (j.organizationId) pm.environment.set('organization_id', j.organizationId);",
                  "pm.test('credenciais salvas', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.environment.get('client_id')).to.be.ok;",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.environment.get('client_secret')).to.be.ok;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"B2B Account Integration\",\n  \"environment\": \"SANDBOX\",\n  \"scopes\": [\n    \"organization.read\",\n    \"wallet.read\",\n    \"transactions.read\",\n    \"pix.read\",\n    \"pix.create\",\n    \"pix.transfer\",\n    \"charges.read\",\n    \"charges.create\",\n    \"charges.cancel\",\n    \"anticipations.read\",\n    \"anticipations.create\",\n    \"onboarding.read\",\n    \"onboarding.submit\"\n  ],\n  \"accountIds\": [\"{{account_id}}\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/organizations/{{organization_id}}/oauth-clients",
            "description": "Cria OAuth client ligado a EXATAMENTE uma Account (1:1).\nO client_secret aparece só nesta resposta — salve-o."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List OAuth Clients",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/organizations/{{organization_id}}/oauth-clients"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Rotate Secret",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.clientSecret) pm.environment.set('client_secret', j.clientSecret);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/organizations/{{organization_id}}/oauth-clients/{{oauth_client_uuid}}/rotate-secret",
            "description": "Gera novo secret (one-shot). Atualiza client_secret no Environment."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke OAuth Client",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/organizations/{{organization_id}}/oauth-clients/{{oauth_client_uuid}}/revoke",
            "description": "Revoga o client e libera a Account para um novo client 1:1. Use no final dos testes de security."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. OAuth Token",
      "description": "Fluxo do parceiro (M2M) — sem JWT de usuário Theron.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Token 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.access_token) pm.environment.set('access_token', j.access_token);",
                  "pm.test('access_token salvo', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.environment.get('access_token')).to.be.ok;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('token_type Bearer', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(j.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{client_id}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{client_secret}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/oauth/token",
            "description": "Client Credentials. Grava access_token (~15 min)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Access Token (invalid secret)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 invalid_client', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('invalid_client');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{client_id}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "wrong-secret" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/oauth/token"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1.4 Theron API Key",
      "description": "OWNER cria Theron API Key (tk_sandbox_/tk_live_) via JWT produto. Use theron_api_key como Bearer nas APIs (equivalente ao OAuth JWT).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Theron API Key (OWNER JWT)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Create API key 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.apiKey) pm.environment.set('theron_api_key', j.apiKey);",
                  "if (j.id) pm.environment.set('theron_api_key_id', j.id);",
                  "pm.test('apiKey plaintext uma vez', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.environment.get('theron_api_key')).to.match(/^tk_(sandbox|live)_/);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{owner_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Postman Integration\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/developer/api-keys",
            "description": "Requer JWT OWNER (owner_access_token). Secret aparece só nesta resposta."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Theron API Keys",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{owner_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/developer/api-keys",
            "description": "Nunca devolve plaintext apiKey."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Charges with Theron API Key",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{theron_api_key}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/charges",
            "description": "Bearer tk_* autentica como CLIENT bound à Account MAIN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Rotate Theron API Key",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.apiKey) pm.environment.set('theron_api_key', j.apiKey);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{owner_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/developer/api-keys/{{theron_api_key_id}}/rotate"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke Theron API Key",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{owner_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/developer/api-keys/{{theron_api_key_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1.5 Onboarding Asaas (B2B)",
      "description": "Provisiona a subconta Asaas da Account vinculada ao OAuth (sem login no site). Exige scopes onboarding.read / onboarding.submit. Header Idempotency-Key obrigatório no POST.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Onboarding Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/asaas/onboarding/b2b",
            "description": "Estado atual do onboarding da Account do client."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit Onboarding CPF (INDIVIDUAL)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('onboarding_idempotency_key')) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('onboarding_idempotency_key', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Onboarding submit 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('sem apiKey na resposta', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(j.apiKey).to.be.undefined;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{onboarding_idempotency_key}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"personType\": \"INDIVIDUAL\",\n  \"personal\": {\n    \"name\": \"Bruno Santos\",\n    \"cpf\": \"52998224725\",\n    \"birthDate\": \"1990-01-15\",\n    \"email\": \"bruno@example.com\",\n    \"mobilePhone\": \"11999998888\"\n  },\n  \"address\": {\n    \"address\": \"Rua das Flores\",\n    \"addressNumber\": \"100\",\n    \"complement\": \"Apto 1\",\n    \"province\": \"Centro\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"01310100\",\n    \"city\": \"São Paulo\"\n  },\n  \"financial\": { \"incomeValue\": 5000.00 }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/asaas/onboarding/b2b",
            "description": "One-shot KYC PF + criação da subconta Asaas. Idempotent por Idempotency-Key."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit Onboarding CNPJ (COMPANY)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"personType\": \"COMPANY\",\n  \"business\": {\n    \"cnpj\": \"60746948000112\",\n    \"legalName\": \"Empresa Exemplo LTDA\",\n    \"tradeName\": \"Exemplo\",\n    \"email\": \"financeiro@exemplo.com\",\n    \"mobilePhone\": \"11988887777\",\n    \"companyType\": \"LIMITED\"\n  },\n  \"address\": {\n    \"address\": \"Av. Paulista\",\n    \"addressNumber\": \"1000\",\n    \"province\": \"Bela Vista\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"01310100\",\n    \"city\": \"São Paulo\"\n  },\n  \"financial\": { \"incomeValue\": 50000.00 }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/asaas/onboarding/b2b",
            "description": "Exemplo PJ. Use uma Account ainda sem subconta (ou outra chave de idempotência)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Subaccount Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/asaas/subaccount/status/b2b",
            "description": "financialResourcesEnabled deve ser true antes de PIX/charges."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Conta Wallet Org",
      "description": "Rotas autenticadas com Bearer access_token do OAuth client.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Account",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Get account 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Wallet",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Get wallet 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const id = j.id || (j.wallet && j.wallet.id);",
                  "if (id) pm.environment.set('wallet_id', id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account_id}}/wallet",
            "description": "Salva wallet_id no Environment."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Ledger Balance",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account_id}}/ledger-balance"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Organization",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organization_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Transactions by Wallet",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/transactions?walletId={{wallet_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "transactions"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "walletId", "value": "{{wallet_id}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Isolamento Security",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Other Account (expect 403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Conta fora do 1:1 retorna 403', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/accounts/{{other_account_id}}",
            "description": "Preencha other_account_id com outra Account (mesma org ou outra). Deve falhar com 403."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "After Revoke - Get Account (expect 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Rode antes: 0. Setup Admin → Revoke OAuth Client",
                  "// Mantém o access_token antigo no Environment para validar rejeição imediata."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Client revogado retorna 401', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account_id}}",
            "description": "Ordem: Get Access Token → Revoke OAuth Client → este request (com token antigo)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. PIX Sandbox",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List PIX Keys",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/pix/keys?accountId={{account_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "pix", "keys"],
              "query": [{ "key": "accountId", "value": "{{account_id}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List PIX Transfers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/pix/transfers?accountId={{account_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "pix", "transfers"],
              "query": [{ "key": "accountId", "value": "{{account_id}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PIX Transfer (with Idempotency-Key)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"accountId\": \"{{account_id}}\",\n  \"amount\": 1.00,\n  \"destinationPixKey\": \"{{pix_destination_key}}\",\n  \"destinationPixKeyType\": \"{{pix_destination_key_type}}\",\n  \"description\": \"Postman B2B sandbox\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/pix/transfers",
            "description": "MOVE DINHEIRO no provedor (só sandbox). Header Idempotency-Key obrigatório."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PIX Transfer without Idempotency-Key (expect error)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Sem Idempotency-Key falha', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 422]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"accountId\": \"{{account_id}}\",\n  \"amount\": 1.00,\n  \"destinationPixKey\": \"{{pix_destination_key}}\",\n  \"destinationPixKeyType\": \"{{pix_destination_key_type}}\",\n  \"description\": \"should fail\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/pix/transfers"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Charges",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Charge PIX",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
